      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, my knee is killing me today. the osteoarthritis is acting up really bad and it's hard to walk. i have some ibuprofen at home, is it okay if i take some to help with the swelling? i'm currently on Eliquis for my afib so i just wanna make sure it's safe to mix them.",
